OL,3,AMy approach to EU is pragmatic, says   
OL,4,ABurnham                                
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said new        
OL,7,Fagreements with the EU are "pragmatic" 
OL,8,Fand "not a prelude to anything", as he 
OL,9,Foutlined his agreement with the bloc to
OL,10,FMPs.                                   
OL,12,FAndy Burnham told the Commons there was
OL,13,F"no fixed destination" on talks to     
OL,14,Fexplore closer ties with the European  
OL,15,FUnion, adding it would be "unthinkable"
OL,16,Ffor the UK to rejoin the bloc without a
OL,17,Freferendum.                            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
