OL,3,AUS rapper postpones O2 arena show after
OL,4,AManchester evacuation                  
OL,6,FUS rapper Don Toliver has postponed his
OL,7,FMonday show at London's O2 arena, a day
OL,8,Fafter his concert in Manchester was    
OL,9,Fevacuated when an "unknown substance"  
OL,10,Fwas released into the crowd.           
OL,12,F"I'm very sad to sit here and say I    
OL,13,Fhave to reschedule The O2 London show  
OL,14,Fto December 15th due to [the]          
OL,15,Funfortunate incident last night," he   
OL,16,Fwrote on Instagram.                    
OL,18,FOne person was taken to hospital and a 
OL,19,Ftotal of 89 people showed "symptoms    
OL,20,Fbelieved to be linked to the exposure" 
OL,21,Fafter Sunday's Co-op Live arena show,  
OL,22,Fpolice said.                           
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
